<title>FINLAND: FINNISH JAN CONSTRUCTION COSTS RISE 1.4 PCT YR/YR.</title>
<headline>FINNISH JAN CONSTRUCTION COSTS RISE 1.4 PCT YR/YR.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-02-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish construction costs rose 1.4 percent year-on-year in January after a fall of 0.2 percent in December, Statistics Finland (SF) said in a statement on Friday.</p>
<p>The construction costs index rose 0.3 percent month-on-month in January, SF said.  </p>
<p>Year-on-year, material input costs rose 1.2 percent and labour costs increased 3.4 percent while other input costs fell 1.3 percent, SF said.</p>
<p>Month-on-month, material input costs rose 0.2 percent, labour costs rose 0.6 percent and other input costs were flat.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom + 358-9-680 50 240</p>
</text>
